1
00:00:12,371 --> 00:00:15,874
Evening settles on the fields,

2
00:00:15,874 --> 00:00:19,177
Daylight leaves the windowpane.

3
00:00:19,418 --> 00:00:22,431
I lay my plans before You, King,

4
00:00:23,192 --> 00:00:25,824
And softly speak Your name.

5
00:00:25,894 --> 00:00:29,476
Jesus, all my days are Yours,

6
00:00:29,476 --> 00:00:32,719
Every road and everything.

7
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:35,902
Here beside this quiet light,

8
00:00:35,942 --> 00:00:40,175
I give my heart to You, my King.

9
00:00:40,385 --> 00:00:44,617
Jesus, my King, Your will be done,

10
00:00:44,617 --> 00:00:47,990
In every word, in all my ways.

11
00:00:47,990 --> 00:00:51,434
All power is Yours, Your throne stands sure,

12
00:00:51,434 --> 00:00:54,916
Through changing winds and passing days.

13
00:00:54,994 --> 00:00:58,566
Holy Spirit, draw me close,

14
00:00:58,566 --> 00:01:01,639
Help me hear and follow through.

15
00:01:01,760 --> 00:01:05,360
Let my love say yes today,

16
00:01:05,360 --> 00:01:09,395
And let my footsteps honor You.

17
00:01:10,806 --> 00:01:13,898
When the morning calls me out

18
00:01:14,078 --> 00:01:17,490
To the work my hands must do,

19
00:01:17,692 --> 00:01:20,754
Let the kindness in my voice

20
00:01:20,754 --> 00:01:24,176
Show that I belong to You.

21
00:01:24,364 --> 00:01:27,507
When You ask me to forgive,

22
00:01:27,797 --> 00:01:31,200
When You lead me to make peace,

23
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:34,503
Let me gladly do Your will,

24
00:01:34,503 --> 00:01:37,722
Even when it costs me ease.

25
00:01:37,722 --> 00:01:41,163
Jesus, my King, Your will be done,

26
00:01:41,163 --> 00:01:44,540
In every word, in all my ways.

27
00:01:44,540 --> 00:01:48,006
All power is Yours, Your throne stands sure,

28
00:01:48,006 --> 00:01:51,548
Through changing winds and passing days.

29
00:01:51,561 --> 00:01:55,142
Holy Spirit, draw me close,

30
00:01:55,142 --> 00:01:58,313
Help me hear and follow through.

31
00:01:58,343 --> 00:02:01,784
Let my love say yes today,

32
00:02:01,784 --> 00:02:05,795
And let my footsteps honor You.

33
00:02:19,030 --> 00:02:22,272
Holy Spirit, here with me,

34
00:02:22,462 --> 00:02:26,074
You know all I hold inside.

35
00:02:26,144 --> 00:02:29,366
When my heart would turn away,

36
00:02:29,366 --> 00:02:32,567
Gently bring it to the light.

37
00:02:32,704 --> 00:02:35,756
Teach me how to walk with You,

38
00:02:36,167 --> 00:02:39,529
Keep me mindful through the day.

39
00:02:40,021 --> 00:02:43,063
When I hear the King’s command,

40
00:02:43,063 --> 00:02:47,315
Help me answer and obey.

41
00:02:47,315 --> 00:02:49,826
Over every land and sea,

42
00:02:50,328 --> 00:02:53,470
Over all that breathes and lives,

43
00:02:53,511 --> 00:02:57,063
Jesus, Yours the right to rule,

44
00:02:57,063 --> 00:03:00,444
Yours the word that stands and lives.

45
00:03:00,444 --> 00:03:03,656
Let Your Kingdom come through me,

46
00:03:03,837 --> 00:03:07,088
In the small things love can do.

47
00:03:07,480 --> 00:03:10,362
With a willing, quiet heart,

48
00:03:10,502 --> 00:03:14,104
I will give my yes to You.

49
00:03:14,995 --> 00:03:19,397
Jesus, my King, Your will be done,

50
00:03:19,397 --> 00:03:22,880
In every word, in all my ways.

51
00:03:22,880 --> 00:03:26,484
All power is Yours, Your throne stands sure,

52
00:03:26,484 --> 00:03:30,096
Through changing winds and passing days.

53
00:03:30,154 --> 00:03:33,766
Holy Spirit, draw me close,

54
00:03:33,766 --> 00:03:37,139
Help me hear and follow through.

55
00:03:37,139 --> 00:03:40,502
Let my love say yes today,

56
00:03:40,502 --> 00:03:44,594
And let my footsteps honor You.

57
00:03:46,145 --> 00:03:49,487
Holy Spirit, here with me,

58
00:03:50,048 --> 00:03:53,270
As the night grows still and deep.

59
00:03:53,731 --> 00:03:57,414
Jesus, You are King forever,

60
00:03:57,495 --> 00:04:03,239
All my days are Yours to lead.
